``` Low-and-slow password spray: many distinct source IPs each staying
    under any single-entity threshold, fanning out against one host.
    Mirrors detection/ssh_bruteforce.py::detect_password_spray().
    Saved in the live instance as "Login Integrity - SSH Low-and-Slow Password Spray". ```
index=login_integrity_ssh success=0
| bucket _time span=5h
| stats dc(src_ip) as distinct_sources values(username) as usernames_tried by target_host _time
| where distinct_sources>=8
| sort -distinct_sources
